# Copy to web/.env.local (never commit real values).
#
# Mapbox PUBLIC token (starts with pk.). It ships to the browser by design, so restrict it by URL
# in the Mapbox dashboard: localhost and the exact production domain only, never *.vercel.app.
# A secret token (sk.) makes the build fail. If left empty, the app shows a "missing token" state.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
